sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Receptionist as Receptionist
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Receptionist->>System: fetchPendingAdmissionRequests()
    activate System
    System-->>Receptionist: displayAdmissionRequests(admissionList)
    deactivate System

    Receptionist->>System: allocateBedAndAdmit(admissionId, wardId, bedId)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifyBedAvailability()
    System->>System: updateBedStatusToOccupied()
    System->>System: activateIPAdmission()
    System-->>Receptionist: bedAllocatedSuccess(admissionId, bedId, status="Admitted")
    deactivate System
